  "description": "Introducing the all-new Maui Bikes Nova — a modern step-through e-bike designed to make every ride effortless, comfortable, and enjoyable.\nBuilt around a sleek, easy-access step-through frame, the Nova offers confident handling and all-day comfort for riders of all experience levels. At its heart is a powerful Bafang mid-drive motor, delivering smooth, responsive pedal assistance with excellent climbing capability and a natural riding feel. The mid-drive system efficiently transfers power through the drivetrain, providing balanced performance whether you're commuting, exploring local paths, or enjoying weekend adventures.\nThe Nova is equipped with trusted components from some of the most respected names in cycling. Shimano drivetrain components ensure precise and reliable shifting, while Tektro hydraulic disc brakes deliver powerful, confidence-inspiring stopping performance in all riding conditions.\nThe Nova also features built-in Apple Find My technology, allowing owners to locate their bike directly through the Find My app on their iPhone, iPad, or Mac. This added feature provides greater peace of mind and makes it easy to track the bike if it is parked, misplaced, or moved unexpectedly.\nCombining premium technology, proven and dependable reliability, and rider-focused comfort, the Maui Bikes Nova is built to take you farther with less effort. Whether you're navigating city streets, tackling rolling hills, or simply enjoying the freedom of electric cycling, the Nova is ready for every journey.\nKey Features\n\nLightweight and accessible step-through frame design\n\nPowerful and efficient Bafang mid-drive motor\n\nSmooth and dependable Shimano drivetrain\n\nResponsive Tektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nComfortable geometry for everyday riding\n\nIdeal for commuting, recreation, and fitness rides\n\nMaui Bikes Nova — Ride farther. Climb easier. Enjoy every kilometre.",
